usage: unitron dis [-h] [-o OUTPUT] [--start START] [--count COUNT] [--executed EXECUTED] [--no-sweep] [--hints HINTS] rom

disassemble: a listing, or (-o DIR) rebuildable asm900 source

positional arguments:
  rom

options:
  -h, --help	show this help message and exit
  -o, --output OUTPUT	write DIR/main.asm that assembles back to the ROM
  --start START
  --count COUNT
  --executed EXECUTED	file of hex code addresses (extra trace entry points)
  --no-sweep	static trace only (no gap sweep)
  --hints HINTS	code/data hints for the gap sweep (see docs/language.md)
